{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Finding Chuchu",
    "steam_appid": 3460690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding ChuChu</strong> is an exhilarating arcade shooting game that anyone can easily enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must dodge various enemy bullets while utilizing different spells, adding a touch of strategy to the shooting gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Attack Spells</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 10 types of attack spells with simple controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master technical controls to unleash powerful, high-efficiency casting spells.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: The main content, featuring an exciting storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade</strong>: A stage-clearing mode without the story elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By signing up and linking an account, play scores are saved to the cloud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View your ranking on the scoreboard with stored scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Map Maker</strong> to create your own maps, save and share them via the cloud, and play maps made by other players.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended for Players Who</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are looking for a fun game that can be enjoyed in a short amount of time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love high-score challenges that test their competitive spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to experience the nostalgic charm of classic arcade games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy creating custom maps and competing with friends.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supported Languages</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text</strong>: Korean, English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish, German, Russian.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice</strong>: Korean.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finding ChuChu</strong> is an exhilarating arcade shooting game that anyone can easily enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must dodge various enemy bullets while utilizing different spells, adding a touch of strategy to the shooting gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Attack Spells</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 10 types of attack spells with simple controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master technical controls to unleash powerful, high-efficiency casting spells.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: The main content, featuring an exciting storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade</strong>: A stage-clearing mode without the story elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By signing up and linking an account, play scores are saved to the cloud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View your ranking on the scoreboard with stored scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Map Maker</strong> to create your own maps, save and share them via the cloud, and play maps made by other players.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended for Players Who</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are looking for a fun game that can be enjoyed in a short amount of time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love high-score challenges that test their competitive spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to experience the nostalgic charm of classic arcade games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy creating custom maps and competing with friends.</p></